{
 "command": "dialog-benchmark-results",
 "notes": [
  "Feeds W8-18s (dialogs::benchmark::{results, run}). Reflection over the internal BenchmarkDialog and DialogColors of the PhotoReview (Shell.Win32) assembly, the public BenchmarkResultRow of PhotoReview.App.Shared and the public BenchmarkProfiles / BenchmarkPhaseResult of PhotoReview.Benchmarking; no window is created. The language is the process default (English).",
  "Output per kind: row_color -> back, text (uint, the RowColors tuple); profile_list -> items [{id, text, badge}] (ListItemText(ProfilesId, index) for every registry profile in order); static_color -> value (uint); palette -> value (uint).",
  "row_color: the rows are added to Presenter.Rows in the given order; source is the lParam of the list view row (its index in Rows), displayed_row the row position on screen. The Rust test maps the golden colours to palette keys (the palette cases give the values) and checks the key chosen by row_color_key. The 'best and failed' row (last) pins that IsBest wins over Fail."
 ],
